{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 21, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The sights and smells of the bustling market were overwhelming, but the fresh sushi I sampled was well worth it. I also had the opportunity to explore the beautiful gardens and temples of Kyoto, including the serene Kinkaku-ji Temple, also known as the Golden Pavilion.\n\nAs I traveled throughout the country, I was struck by the politeness and hospitality of the Japanese people. Everywhere I went, I was greeted with a smile and a bow, and I felt like I was treated like a honored guest.\n\nOne of the most memorable experiences of my trip was taking a ride on the bullet train, or Shinkansen, which whizzed through the countryside at speeds of over 300 kilometers per hour. The scenery outside the window was breathtaking, with rolling hills and picturesque villages flashing by in a blur.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a fascinating and enriching experience that I will never forget. The country's unique culture, stunning natural beauty, and warm hospitality made it a truly special destination. I can't wait to return and explore more of what Japan has to offer.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.40969008207321167}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.003243544837459922}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.9141146923357155e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20399616658687592}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.6840745806694031}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0003486264031380415}, {"t